  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 6.3,
      "e": 7.9,
      "text": "- [Reporter] The oceans of Okinawa are beautiful."
    },
    {
      "s": 7.9,
      "e": 10.03,
      "text": "However, tread these waters safely."
    },
    {
      "s": 10.03,
      "e": 11.92,
      "text": "Currents can drag you out to sea"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.92,
      "e": 15.5,
      "text": "and waves can leave you tumbling across the ocean floor."
    },
    {
      "s": 15.5,
      "e": 18.23,
      "text": "A surfer was recently rescued by two civilians"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.23,
      "e": 20.75,
      "text": "after a wave threw her off her surfboard"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.75,
      "e": 22.29,
      "text": "and against the seawall."
    },
    {
      "s": 22.29,
      "e": 23.61,
      "text": "- As she got hit by a big wave,"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.61,
      "e": 25.62,
      "text": "and was knocked off of her surf board."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.62,
      "e": 27.33,
      "text": "And then another wave knocked her again"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.33,
      "e": 29.81,
      "text": "and slammed her into the seawall,"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.81,
      "e": 32.99,
      "text": "and we, as soon as we saw her disappear from our sight,"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.99,
      "e": 35.78,
      "text": "we ran down to the next level of the seawall."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.78,
      "e": 36.87,
      "text": "Then we were able to grab her"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.87,
      "e": 39.81,
      "text": "and pull her up to the upper level of the seawall."
    },
    {
      "s": 39.81,
      "e": 43.15,
      "text": "We noticed that she had a big gash on her forehead."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.15,
      "e": 45.14,
      "text": "And we immediately applied first aid"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.14,
      "e": 47.48,
      "text": "and tried to get her some help."
    },
    {
      "s": 47.48,
      "e": 48.97,
      "text": "- We're all taught to love one another"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.97,
      "e": 49.86,
      "text": "and take care of each other."
    },
    {
      "s": 49.86,
      "e": 51.89,
      "text": "So when I saw that she was in distress,"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.89,
      "e": 54.53,
      "text": "I even thought about my own daughter or granddaughter"
    },
    {
      "s": 54.53,
      "e": 56.99,
      "text": "and just nothing went through my mind,"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.99,
      "e": 59.94,
      "text": "is to get her out of the ocean as quickly as possible."
    },
    {
      "s": 59.94,
      "e": 62.78,
      "text": "We didn't know what kind of injuries she had at that time,"
    },
    {
      "s": 62.78,
      "e": 64.58,
      "text": "we just knew she needed to get out of the water,"
    },
    {
      "s": 64.58,
      "e": 67.64,
      "text": "so that's what we did, we didn't think twice about it."
    },
    {
      "s": 67.64,
      "e": 68.72,
      "text": "- [Reporter] For their courageous acts,"
    },
    {
      "s": 68.72,
      "e": 71.9,
      "text": "Vice Commander of the 18th Wing, Colonel Amrhein,"
    },
    {
      "s": 71.9,
      "e": 73.73,
      "text": "presented them with the Commander's Coin."
    },
    {
      "s": 73.73,
      "e": 75.8,
      "text": "- A lot of folks came up and congratulated us."
    },
    {
      "s": 75.8,
      "e": 77.78,
      "text": "Just seemed like it was the normal thing to do"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.78,
      "e": 79.22,
      "text": "to save somebody else's life."
    },
    {
      "s": 79.22,
      "e": 80.55,
      "text": "So it was quite an honor."
    },
    {
      "s": 80.55,
      "e": 82.27,
      "text": "We were really humbled by it."
    },
    {
      "s": 82.27,
      "e": 83.55,
      "text": "- [Reporter] A1C Thomas Barley,"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.55,
      "e": 85.47,
      "text": "Kadena Air Base, Japan."
    }
  ],
